SUMMARY:Information: Tottenham Hale Station: Tottenham Hotspur vs Crystal 
 Palace at Tottenham Hotspur Stadium on Saturday 31 October (1730 KO): 
 Tottenham Hale station is expected to be extremely busy between 1530 and 
 1700 and between 1930 and 2100. You may find it easier to use 
 Northumberland Park station where additional trains will call before and 
 after the match
